### StockPulse Products & Commerce API - VS Code REST Client Tests
### Base Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Health Check
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Get All Products
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getAllProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Filter Products by Category (ELECTRONICS)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterByCategory
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=ELECTRONICS HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Filter Products by Status (ACTIVE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterByStatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?status=ACTIVE HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Combine Filters (Status=ACTIVE & Category=HOME)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterByStatusAndCategory
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?status=ACTIVE&category=HOME HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Filter by Status (PRICE_REVIEW_PENDING - Shows PRD-003)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterPriceReviewPending
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?status=PRICE_REVIEW_PENDING HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Get Single Product by Code (PRD-003)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getProductByCode
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-003 HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Create a New Product
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": "PRD-TEST-001",
  "sku": "SKU-ELEC-TEST",
  "name": "Noise Cancelling Headphones X1",
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "currentPrice": 149.99,
  "stockLevel": 35,
  "reorderThreshold": 10,
  "demandVelocity": 4,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Update Stock Level (Set stock to 25 on PRD-003)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateStock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-003/stock HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "stockLevel": 25
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Update Stock to Zero (Verifying Auto-Transition to OUT_OF_STOCK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateStockToZero
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-004/stock HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "stockLevel": 0
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Restore Stock (Verifying Auto-Transition back to ACTIVE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name restoreStock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-004/stock HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "stockLevel": 40
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. Simulate Customer Order (Sale of 1 unit on PRD-008 Hoodie)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Decrements stock by 1, increments demand velocity by 1
# @name simulateOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-008/orders HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. Verify Product State After Simulated Order
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name verifyProductAfterOrder
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-008 HTTP/1.1

### ==================================================================
### COMMERCE ENGINE (PHASE 2B) — SUGGESTION ENDPOINTS
### ==================================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. Suggest Pricing: Low Stock Rule Trigger (PRD-003)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRD-003 has stock: 8, threshold: 15 (stock < threshold)
# Expected: +10% price increase ($24.99 -> $27.49), direction: INCREASE, status: PENDING
# @name suggestPricingLowStock
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-003/suggest-pricing HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "triggerReason": "MANUAL"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. Suggest Reorder: Low Stock Replenishment (PRD-003)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRD-003 has stock: 8, threshold: 15
# Expected: (15 * 3) - 8 = 37 units, leadTime: 7 days, status: PENDING
# @name suggestReorderLowStock
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-003/suggest-reorder HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "triggerReason": "MANUAL"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 16. Suggest Pricing: Demand Spike Rule Trigger (PRD-008)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRD-008 has velocity: 15 vs APPAREL average (~9.7) -> velocity > 2x category avg (when threshold holds)
# Expected: +5% price increase ($54.99 -> $57.74), direction: INCREASE, status: PENDING
# @name suggestPricingDemandSpike
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-008/suggest-pricing HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "triggerReason": "DEMAND_SPIKE"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 17. Suggest Pricing: Normal Conditions -> HOLD (PRD-001)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRD-001 has stock: 45, threshold: 20 (healthy), velocity: 3 vs Electronics avg (~4.0)
# Expected: direction: HOLD, recommendedPrice: $79.99, status: PENDING
# @name suggestPricingHold
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-001/suggest-pricing HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "triggerReason": "MANUAL"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 18. Suggest Reorder: Overstocked / Healthy Inventory (PRD-002)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRD-002 has stock: 120, threshold: 30 -> (30 * 3) - 120 = -30 -> Clamped to min 1 unit
# @name suggestReorderOverstocked
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/PRD-002/suggest-reorder HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "triggerReason": "MANUAL"
}

